  "info": {
    "title": "House",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A four-on-the-floor house track in A minor at 124 BPM: a deep kick on its own track with clap and hats on another, an octave bass that ducks from the kick, a two-chord organ vamp, a running pentatonic lead and a shimmering texture, with a tight chamber and a dotted echo. The first drop has no lead: add a hook there. Draw a filter sweep on the lead across the build, or move the break to change where the energy falls."
  },
